      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood sits between Cedar Lake to the west and Lake of the Isles to the east, with the Kenilworth Lagoon and Lake of the Isles forming its northern and eastern borders.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cedar-Isles-Dean%2C_Minneapolis",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Kenilworth Trail runs through the heart of Cedar‑Isles‑Dean, following a former railroad corridor that once carried the Minneapolis & St. Paul Railway.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
